<title>USA: Money manager says Chase undervalued - report.</title>
<headline>Money manager says Chase undervalued - report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friedman Billings Ramsey partner Robert Feinstein says Chase Manhattan Corp and Student Loan Marketing Association may be undervalued, according to Business Week's &quot;Inside Wall Street&quot;.</p>
<p>The money manager has chosen a range of stocks including small caps. Among the stocks he says are undervalued: Ugly Duckling Corp, RAC Financial Group, Styling Technology Corp.</p>
<p>Friedman Billing' picks rose 75 percent in 1995 and another 30 percent in 1996, the financial magazine said.</p>
